Dispatch {{.FocusedSpec}} to the task board by calling POST /api/specs/transition with {"action": "dispatch", "paths": ["{{.FocusedSpec}}"]}. First verify the spec status is "validated", all depends_on specs are "complete", and the spec is a leaf (no children). The server creates the task, writes dispatched_task_id, and commits, so never write that field or a placeholder UUID by hand. Then update the corresponding entry in specs/README.md.